I defined the campaign checks, product requirements and account-team workflow, then worked with **AI coding agents** to build the dashboard. The early tool brought together KPI views, campaign health checks, English and Vietnamese reporting, competitor research and PDF reports.

My part was to translate marketing judgment into product rules: which metrics belong to the campaign objective, what counts as a useful comparison, what evidence supports a recommendation, and when the team needs to review an action. I directed the development, reviewed the outputs and revised flows that ran correctly but still led to a weak recommendation.
